  m_Name: CauhoiXutHo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  TextQuestion: "Kho\u1EA3ng c\xE1ch t\u1EADp k\u1EBFt v\u1EADt li\u1EC7u n\xE0y
    ti\u1EC1m \u1EA9n r\u1EE7i ro g\xEC?"
  TextListAnswer:
  - "[A] S\u1EA1t l\u1EDF h\u1ED1 \u0111\xE0o v\xE0 r\u01A1i v\u1EADt t\u01B0 tr\xFAng
    ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\xEAn d\u01B0\u1EDBi."
  - "[B] L\xE0m han g\u1EC9 v\u1EADt t\u01B0 do g\u1EA7n ngu\u1ED3n n\u01B0\u1EDBc
    ng\u1EA7m."
  - "[C] C\xF4ng nh\xE2n d\u1EC5 b\u1ECB v\u1EA5p ng\xE3 khi \u0111i ngang qua."
  correctAnwer: 0
